Chapter: CardDeckShuffleTest
  cites Game chapter CardDeck

 fy-next-random is a linear congruential generator, seed * 1103515245 + 12345,
 and fy-mod takes its remainder. An LCG's low bits have famously short
 periods -- bit 0 alternates, bit 1 has period four -- and Fisher-Yates counts
 DOWN, so the last swaps use the smallest moduli and therefore the most
 degenerate bits. A shuffle built this way is not a permutation drawn evenly;
 it is a small family of permutations selected by the low bits of the seed.

   spread       over many seeds, where does one nominated card land? A fair
                shuffle puts it in every position about equally often. This
                catches positions that are unreachable.
   alternation  over CONSECUTIVE seeds, does a two-card deck's outcome flip
                every single time? A perfect flip is a stripe carrying no
                information, and it is invisible to any count-based check
                because it is also perfectly balanced. This is the same
                signature the shared mixer had (see codex/test/mix-bits).

Section: Fixtures

  cdt-fresh : Integer, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  cdt-fresh (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else cdt-fresh (i + 1) n (list-push acc i)

  cdt-pos-of : List Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cdt-pos-of (xs) (v) (i) (n) =
    if i >= n then 0 - 1
    else if list-at xs i == v then i
    else cdt-pos-of xs v (i + 1) n

  cdt-zeros : Integer, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  cdt-zeros (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else cdt-zeros (i + 1) n (list-push acc 0)

Section: Spread

  cdt-tally : Integer, Integer, List Integer -> List Integer
  cdt-tally (seed) (trials) (counts) =
    if seed >= trials then counts
    else let deck = cdt-fresh 0 8 []
    in let shuffled = deck-shuffle deck seed
    in let p = cdt-pos-of shuffled 0 0 8
    in if p < 0 then cdt-tally (seed + 1) trials counts
    else cdt-tally (seed + 1) trials (list-set-at counts p (list-at counts p + 1))

  cdt-min : List Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cdt-min (xs) (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else let v = list-at xs i
    in cdt-min xs (i + 1) n (if v < acc then v else acc)

  cdt-max : List Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cdt-max (xs) (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else let v = list-at xs i
    in cdt-max xs (i + 1) n (if v > acc then v else acc)

  cdt-fmt : List Integer, Integer, Integer, Text -> Text
  cdt-fmt (xs) (i) (n) (acc) =
    if i >= n then acc
    else let sep = if i == 0 then "" else " "
    in cdt-fmt xs (i + 1) n (acc & sep & show (list-at xs i))

Section: Alternation

  cdt-two : Integer -> Integer
  cdt-two (seed) =
    let deck = cdt-fresh 0 2 []
    in let shuffled = deck-shuffle deck seed
    in list-at shuffled 0

  cdt-alt : Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  cdt-alt (seed) (trials) (acc) =
    if seed >= trials then acc
    else let a = cdt-two seed
    in let b = cdt-two (seed - 1)
    in cdt-alt (seed + 1) trials (acc + (if a == b then 0 else 1))

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing =
    let counts = cdt-tally 0 256 (cdt-zeros 0 8 [])
    in let lo = cdt-min counts 0 8 999999
    in let hi = cdt-max counts 0 8 0
    in let alt = cdt-alt 1 256 0
    in act
      print-line-uni ("counts:        " & cdt-fmt counts 0 8 "")
      print-line-uni ("min:           " & show lo)
      print-line-uni ("max:           " & show hi)
      print-line-uni ("every pos hit: " & show (lo > 0))
      print-line-uni ("within 3x:     " & show (hi <= lo * 3))
      print-line-uni ("alternations:  " & show alt)
      print-line-uni ("not a stripe:  " & show (alt < 200))
    end
